", "id": 11}], "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": true, "type": "has_nav"}, {"content": true, "type": "has_exercise_controls"}], "type": "lab_options"}], "type": "scholar", "id": 0, "stimuli": [{"type": "welcome", "_data": [], "template_override": 1, "contents": [{}], "id": 0}, {"type": "audio", "template_override": 1, "title": "", "_data": [], "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"coverimg": "engenn8le11ob10re2img05.jpg", "audiosrc": "engenn8le11ob10re2aud01", "images": [{"time": "0", "image": "engenn8le11ob10re2img05.jpg", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"time": "100", "image": "engenn8le11ob10re2img05.jpg", "id": 1, "text": "Dear readers,<br/><br/>I received this message from a concerned reader. <br/><br/>Yesterday I went to my local health clinic to make an appointment. I arrived at 9:30 a.m. The girl behind the counter was talking on the telephone. She motioned for me to sit down. There were three other people behind the counter: a young woman, an older man, and a very efficient-looking matron. The young woman was filing her nails. The older man was reading a magazine. The efficient-looking matron was staring into space. I sat down to wait. I waited for about half an hour.\nObviously the clerks weren't working, and I was really annoyed."}, {"time": "39000", "image": "engenn8le11ob10re2img01.jpg", "id": 2, "text": "Finally I decided to assert myself. I went up to the counter. The older man was drinking a cup of coffee. The girl was looking for something in her purse. The efficient matron was eating a sandwich. The young woman had completely disappeared. I decided to try the efficient matron.<br/>\n\"Excuse me,\" I said, \"I have been waiting for half an hour. None of you are working. It seems to me that no one is available to help me.\u201d"}, {"time": "65000", "image": "engenn8le11ob10re2img02.jpg", "id": 3, "text": "\"I'm sorry,\" the matron said. \"Can't you see that this is our break? Come back in half an hour.\"<br/>\nI was so angry, I didn't know what to do!<br/><br/>Here are some reactions on my blog:<br/><br/>\u201cAs far as I'm concerned, you should tell on them and stand up for our rights as consumers\u201d.<br/>\n\u201cI'm convinced that customer service is going downhill these days. We need to stand up to it!\u201d.<br/>\n\u201cMy personal view is that you got angry too quickly\u201d."}]}}], "id": 1}]}], "type": "sena"}